module jev_lsp_capability_discovery_followup

input capability_discovery_observation
input query_digest
input provenance_digest
ainput declaration_source_digest
input discovery_digest

status BOUND read-only capability selection questions are available
status DEFERRED an explicit external boundary remains
status UNKNOWN the earliest discovery boundary remains unresolved

field status
field questions
field first_boundary
field is_read_only
field query_digest
field provenance_digest
field declaration_source_digest
field discovery_digest

constraint lsp_projection_only
constraint preserve_query_evidence
constraint preserve_provenance_evidence
constraint preserve_declaration_evidence
constraint preserve_first_boundary
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint no_mutation
